{
  "title": { "zh": "量词的德摩根律", "en": "De Morgan for quantifiers" },
  "tray": "proof",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "「没有人在喝酒」和「人人都没在喝酒」是一回事。∃ 像一个很长的「或者」，∀ 像一个很长的「并且」，所以<wiki-ref to=\"demorgan\"></wiki-ref>对量词也成立。",
        "en": "“Nobody is drinking” and “everyone is not drinking” say the same. ∃ is like a long “or” and ∀ a long “and”, so <wiki-ref to=\"demorgan\"></wiki-ref> hold for quantifiers too."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "四个方向都证出后，<part-ref to=\"lemma:dm\"></part-ref>多出四个形状。",
        "en": "Once all four directions are proved, <part-ref to=\"lemma:dm\"></part-ref> gains four shapes."
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "q-dm_1",
      "kind": "proof",
      "step": { "zh": "一个都没有", "en": "Not a single one" },
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "¬∃x. P(x)" }, "goal": "∀x. ¬P(x)" }],
      "cases": [{ "P": "Drinks" }, { "P": "Sings" }],
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "任取一个 a，要证的是「¬a在喝酒」。", "en": "Take any a; the goal is “¬a is drinking”." },
        {
          "zh": "假设 a 在喝酒，它就是已知所否认的那种例子。",
          "en": "Suppose a is drinking: then a is just the kind of example the given denies."
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "g = allI[x=a](body: f) {",
        "  body {",
        "    f = impI[A=\"P(a)\"](body: m) {",
        "      body {",
        "        i = exI(f.body)",
        "        m = mp(p, i)",
        "      }",
        "    }",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "goal <- g"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "q-dm_2",
      "kind": "proof",
      "step": { "zh": "都不，就是没有", "en": "All not is none" },
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "∀x. ¬P(x)" }, "goal": "¬∃x. P(x)" }],
      "cases": [{ "P": "Drinks" }, { "P": "Sings" }],
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "要证的是一个否定：假设有人在喝酒。", "en": "The goal is a negation: suppose someone is drinking." },
        { "zh": "把这个人取出来，已知对他也成立。", "en": "Take that person out; the given holds of them too." }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "f = impI[A=\"exists x. P(x)\"](body: e) {",
        "  body {",
        "    e = exE[x=a](f.body, body: m) {",
        "      body {",
        "        a = allE[t=a](p)",
        "        m = mp(a, e.body)",
        "      }",
        "    }",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "goal <- f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "q-dm_3",
      "kind": "proof",
      "step": { "zh": "有一个不", "en": "One who does not" },
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "∃x. ¬P(x)" }, "goal": "¬∀x. P(x)" }],
      "cases": [{ "P": "Drinks" }, { "P": "Sings" }],
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "假设人人都在喝酒。", "en": "Suppose everyone is drinking." },
        { "zh": "把那个没喝的人取出来：他也在「人人」之中。", "en": "Take out the one who is not drinking: they are among “everyone” too." }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "f = impI[A=\"forall x. P(x)\"](body: e) {",
        "  body {",
        "    e = exE[x=a](p, body: m) {",
        "      body {",
        "        a = allE[t=a](f.body)",
        "        m = mp(e.body, a)",
        "      }",
        "    }",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "goal <- f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "q-dm_4",
      "kind": "proof",
      "step": { "zh": "并非人人", "en": "Not everyone" },
      "sentences": ["¬∃x. ¬P(x)"],
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "¬∀x. P(x)" }, "goal": "∃x. ¬P(x)" }],
      "cases": [{ "P": "Drinks" }, { "P": "Sings" }],
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "已知里没有一个具体的人可以举出来。试试反证。", "en": "The given names nobody to point to. Try proof by contradiction." },
        {
          "zh": "假设「¬∃x. ¬x在喝酒」，再看能不能证出人人都在喝酒。",
          "en": "Assume “¬∃x. ¬x is drinking”, and see whether everyone drinking follows."
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "k = impI[A=\"~exists x. ~P(x)\"](body: m2) {",
        "  body {",
        "    g = allI[x=a](body: r1) {",
        "      body {",
        "        j = impI[A=\"~P(a)\"](body: mj) {",
        "          body {",
        "            i = exI(j.body)",
        "            mj = mp(k.body, i)",
        "          }",
        "        }",
        "        r1 = raa(j)",
        "      }",
        "    }",
        "    m2 = mp(p, g)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "r2 = raa(k)",
        "goal <- r2"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
